# Module tfvars holds an alert email; CI supplies notify_emails + budget via
# TF_VAR_* repo variables instead. Keep terraform.tfvars.example committed.
# NOTE: bootstrap/terraform.tfvars is intentionally committed (no secrets,
# only repo/account/bucket names) so the bootstrap is reproducible.
/terraform-ai-cost/terraform.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars

